*The first line is **Ideal** and the second is **Actual**.*

## How Remaining Work Is Calculated

- A work unit counts as remaining until its status on the Sprint Backlog is set to Complete.
- Only work units marked in scope count (6 of 9; the other 3 were descoped mid-sprint, see the Sprint Goal).
- Ideal is a straight line from the scope total (6) down to zero across the 10 sprint days.
- Actual is recorded by hand at the end of each work day, since it is the evidence of real progress.

